      "function_name": "oracleRuntime",
      "description": "Processes a user message through the Oracle runtime pipeline (Guardian \u2192 Nexus \u2192 Spark \u2192 Platform Services). Use this for ALL user messages that require AI reasoning, knowledge retrieval, or platform actions. Pass { message, action: 'process' } or { action: 'health' } for health checks."
    },
